 *     MAKE appsignin AWrongPasswordGetsNoToken
 *     MAKE appsignin AnUnknownAccountGetsNoToken
 *     MAKE appsignin AMemberWithMFAIsAskedForThePasscode
 *     MAKE appsignin TheRightPasscodeSignsTheAppIn
 *     MAKE appsignin APasscodeHandleSignsTheAppInOnlyOnce
 *     MAKE appsignin APasscodeHandleExpiresAfterTenMinutes
 *     MAKE appsignin AWrongPasscodeGetsNoToken
